## Helicopter air assault (IDEA-47, rules/air-assault.yaml)

notification-px-fast-rope-mode = Fast-rope: click the landing zone (Shift+click to queue, right click to cancel).
notification-px-fast-rope-none = Select a transport helicopter with soldiers aboard to fast-rope.
notification-px-fast-rope-blocked = No room to fast-rope there: the helicopter is climbing away with the rest of its troops.
